<H1>Motorcycle Trip to Winthrop, WA May 11, 2021</H1>
<BR>
<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=14T8u24PK5Tef4ksE4R3LP9PYVCfZ4REE" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_moscow_20210511.jpg" ALIGN=RIGHT style="width:592px"></A>
A playlist of all of <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL65CwO7O2fX-r8vjvdPtnMEc6rC0UnjN5" target="_blank">the videos from</A> the ride from May 11 thru May 14, 2021.
<BR><BR>
Riding up the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_State_Route_20" target="_blank">State Route 20 North Cascades Pass</A> you are always surrounded by amazing scenery 
<BR><BR>
Starting up the North Cascades pass near the Skagit Dam, requisite shot of the motorcycle packed and trip worthy:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XNKzOCrCwUVGOK-ER69WfUqMj80jyxAT/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_moscow_20210511_1_Skagit_dam_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
A picture of the mountains and the <A HREF="https://www.google.com/maps/@48.6960761,-121.2139861,1332m/data=!3m1!1e3" target="_blank">Skagit River Dam</A>:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rIheygMG665TYLKYptFFNUaF_7hywJd8/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_moscow_20210511_2_Skagit_dam_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
When you get close to the Dam on the Skagit River <a href="https://youtu.be/H8wWPsNEdCE" target="_blank">State Route 20</A> has LOTS of twisties in store and the mountains start to come fully in view.
<BR><BR>
Further up the mountains is <A HREF="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diablo_Lake" target="_blank">Diablo Lake</A>. It is hard NOT to take a good picture of this lake:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ru9IRisawCfsfKuzxYf5ogJolV-9XiLf/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_moscow_20210511_3_Diablo_lake_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
I was able to ride through the pass 5 days after it opened to traffic, LOTS of snow still around:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MJuHt0y2X6Y8EJG3K3OSDQvoWtyzovxt/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_moscow_20210511_4_North_cascades_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
A video of riding <a href="https://youtu.be/_FYDouFY2cw" target="_blank">over the pass</A>, as you can imageine nothing but peace and beauty.
<BR><BR>
More landscapes with the snow:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bA0BIi8Ssm-sfa8sA7wwoncRUeALQOco/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_moscow_20210511_5_North_cascades_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
And finally a picture of Washington Pass at the peak:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1q91LxdgOJZhwFcVJKnEC64_4Lo7de6wT/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_moscow_20210511_6_North_cascades_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
From there I went to my lodgings in Winthrop, WA for the night.
<BR><BR>
